{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multi-profile RNA-only setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5191 and F1 of 0.4797. The result suggests that transformer aggregation may not match the performance of avgpool aggregation (config_002), but the exact contribution of multi-profile data versus aggregation method remains uncertain. The lower performance compared to config_002 indicates potential benefits from avgpool, though other factors could influence the difference."
}

